# wisecat per-ticker training caches — large yfinance pulls (one parquet
# per ticker), regenerable, do not belong in the repo. The shared
# cross-sectional / regime parquets under data/context/ ARE committed
# (they ship with the Lambda image), and the model artifacts under
# models/ are also committed so the Lambda image is self-contained.
wisecat/data/cache_*.parquet
